  "_about": [
    "Search acceptance set. Each case computes the SERVED list for its query over tests/acceptance/fixtures/serving_rows_2026_09_16.json through the same rankAndServeBeautyRecallProducts the route calls (contract, effective query, multi-family relaxation, scoring with hard constraints, ranking, dedupe, serving gate). A safe-empty contract serves nothing.",
